{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ba73189c078e392f50abe166ede6896424145e4e2144501dd0fec1e7fc26350", "ja": "（可憐と買い物に出かけた帰り際、\nサプライズで、バレンタインのチョコをもらった……）", "zh": "（和可怜买完东西准备回去时，她突然送了我情人节巧克力作为惊喜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1a917b82fbd6a3f21d987d027106255084fb76d932ac483b769632fee318c20c", "ja": "わざわざ用意してくれたのか。\nありがとう、可憐。家でじっくり味わうよ。", "zh": "特意为我准备的吗？\n谢谢你，可怜。回家后我会好好品尝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "5105ab5cba197ccc096a69297bb8711e9c8ec2ce659899ef934ea73831fbb39d", "ja": "こ、こちらこそ……受け取ってくれて、ありがとう\nございます……！　わ、渡せて……よかったぁ。", "zh": "我、我才要谢谢你……愿意收下，谢谢……！能、能送给你……太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "d0760e5929aabe9037c3dc9a6f0decb35a9b95cfc610c1c00645a62afdba4fc7", "ja": "このまま……渡せなかったら、どうしようって……。\n私、ずっと心配で……。", "zh": "我一直在担心……要是就这样没能交给你的话，该怎么办……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1004_p", "source_sha256": "35ddf35db87817e13d0ab669b2e636f046c8b9ad77a351e07d78d3c30cc417b9", "ja": "そうだったのか。……あっ！\nそれじゃ、途中からソワソワしてたのは……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。……啊！\n那么，你从中途开始就坐立不安，是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "cf4fd7b5b2a445fc24c62a8e98617ba02e9aebe30d1ecbe8acf5687d26a26049", "ja": "は、はい……。じ、実は何度も、チョコを取り出そうと\nしたんですけど、タイミングが悪くて……。", "zh": "是、是的……其、其实我好几次都想把巧克力拿出来，可时机不太合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8dce874a1bf3901f7e54c9fea00857db77b9bb336e320c4d8ccfdf258cb9b7ed", "ja": "そうか……。気づけなくて、ごめんな。\nもう少し気遣えればよかったんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊……没能察觉到，对不起。\n本来应该再多替你考虑一些的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "a1c52ae20c4597ed4e88cd119ee2e4bb196658ad34a86a91c2a9638df8bcbb43", "ja": "い、いえ……！　元はと言えば、私が……\nなかなか勇気を出せなかったのが、原因ですから……。", "zh": "不、不是的……！　说到底……\n都是因为我一直没能拿出勇气来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "a82a8a9a6173c4d44c68a289f03d4a2445e3609b0ef6ce80d44515e21295d1bf", "ja": "やっぱり……バレンタインの贈り物って、\n緊張しますね。いつもより何倍も、勇気が必要で……。", "zh": "果然……情人节的礼物，还是会让人紧张呢。需要比平时多好几倍的勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "bbdb9b97ef66a3d185491e5f7c85ea68fd3df9c4e41d7443751f09edf3b90e37", "ja": "そ、それに、今回のチョコは……\nその……ち、ちょっと頑張って作ったので……。", "zh": "而、而且，这次的巧克力……\n那个……是、是我稍微努力做出来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1010_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "4ddffce9cfd27b9f2ada3f8892b7650b5e6b0e2a9351659e55983a5883886663", "ja": "あっ……！　い、いつも頑張ってないとかじゃなくて\n……今回は、特別に頑張ったというか……。", "zh": "啊……！不、不是说我平时没努力，只是……这次算是特别努力了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "65c7f72922372a8cc1473634afa22fc578c123f43ae40c6ef2e0e456ec28971d", "ja": "{$P$}さんに渡すものだから……\n日頃の感謝とか、ちゃんと伝えたいなって……。", "zh": "因为是送给{$P$}先生的……\n所以想好好传达平时的感谢之情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "f4f375283a38a1db72dd5a0e8ca57f86e8e5a5902326f474e372f4e067188085", "ja": "お、お店のより、劣るかもしれませんけど……\n一応、材料にもこだわったりして……。", "zh": "虽、虽然可能不如店里卖的……\n不过，我在材料上也花了些心思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0ac5d7fe3eec4a2fd48fd852051d7983a8e7fea5d5ac8f6b5d13fe7bd89ae269", "ja": "そうなのか！\nたくさん可憐の気持ちを込めてくれたんだな。", "zh": "是这样啊！\n你在里面倾注了很多可怜的心意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "c3d2380e6ffc5fd9a7adef206e1c60525ee8005ebaab45edf81c9f14dbbc2750", "ja": "は、はい……。チョコの香りは、幸福感や安心感を\n与えてくれて……リラックス効果もあるんです……。", "zh": "是、是的……巧克力的香味能带来幸福感和安心感……还具有放松效果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "5d37d0a58795f11263a0ef194f70df8ded73c4bfdaa5aed449723fa36e0f261d", "ja": "その……いつもお仕事でお忙しいと思うので……\n少しでも、気分転換になればなと思って……。", "zh": "那个……我想您平时工作总是很忙……\n要是能多少帮您转换一下心情就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ba12f4615d76da4620bb6ef725b5ca69de9719b1e7f5758d2d7230835605bda7", "ja": "そこまで考えて作ってくれたのか……。\n嬉しいよ、可憐。本当にありがとうな。", "zh": "你考虑得这么周到，还特意做出来的吗……  \n我很高兴，entity[\"people\",\"可怜\",\"idolmaster character\"]。真的谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ab5b06367ac7c86c0aadef8afdfc4a13155bcd70fe2c7bd3a0af713bea95104", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。\n喜んでもらえたみたいで……私も嬉しいです……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。\n好像让你开心了……我也很开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "1828c10b57a404bd98eef088bec7ec20f8add8128ae0a71be723f020a48ba1ca", "ja": "き……今日は、最高のバレンタインになりました。\n私こそ、幸せな時間をありがとうございます……♪", "zh": "今……今天真是度过了最棒的情人节。\n我才要谢谢您，让我拥有了这段幸福的时光……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0404_1020_p", "source_sha256": "31a74af3641f4409379dc245f4211b74496f3b81e11a0db68f87199a0debc736", "ja": "（帰宅後、可憐のチョコを食べた。可憐のように\n優しい甘さが広がって、日頃の疲れが取れた気がした）", "zh": "（回家后，我吃了可怜的巧克力。像可怜一样温柔的甜味在口中散开，感觉平日的疲劳都消除了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
